<c74object name="gst.riot">
	<digest>
		Input data interface for Ircam IMU receiver modules
	</digest>
	<description>
		<o> gst.riot </o> is an input data interface for Ircam IMU receiver modules. It is compatible with <a haref="Input data interface for Ircam IMU receiver modules">RIoT IMU modules</a> (RIoT2 and v3).
		It relies on sending Open Sound Control (<a href="https://opensoundcontrol.stanford.edu/spec-1_0.html#introduction"> OSC </a>) messages via UDP over Ethernet. Check available port with you Operating System (<a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/103229">Mac OS </a>).
		<o> gst.riot </o> uses internal <o>send</o>/<o>receive</o> to spread resampling clock informations : frameperiod, framerate and sync messages.
	</description>
